        </span>
      </div>
      <p
        style="margin: 8px 0px 0px;"
      >
        The Warehouse Manager sees per-line ordered vs received vs rejected, with the receiver's note. Approve: continue to Stage 3 with the adjusted quantities; the PO becomes PARTIALLY_RECEIVED. Reject: the run goes to the hold step; no receipt is posted for the disputed lines.
      </p>
      <div
        style="margin-top: 8px;"
      >
        <strong>
          Writes
        </strong>
        <ul
          style="margin: 4px 0px 0px; padding-left: 20px;"
        >
          <li>
            <code>
              purchase_order.set_status
            </code>
            <span>
               
              · 
              status
              : 
              <code>
                "PARTIALLY_RECEIVED"
              </code>
            </span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div
        style="margin-top: 8px;"
      >
        <strong>
          Branches
        </strong>
        <ul
          style="margin: 4px 0px 0px; padding-left: 20px;"
        >
          <li>
            approved
             → 
