        Record why the receipt is held. Completing this step ends the run with the named outcome held (ADR-0023 change 6: the spec's hold branch ended in ON_HOLD with no exit). Put-away never happens for the disputed lines. Resuming the receipt is a new run on the same PO.
      </p>
