        style="margin: 8px 0px 0px;"
      >
        Close the receipt. The Action Type closes the PO as RECEIVED when every line is fully received, or PARTIALLY_RECEIVED when the run took the discrepancy branch. The Warehouse Manager is notified automatically. This step replaces the wf-wh-01 put-away task: put-away already happened in Stage 3, so no duplicate task is created. The workflow stays the fallback for a PO that becomes RECEIVED outside a lane.
      </p>
